<title>USA: Littlefield, Adams &amp; Co sees Q1 loss.</title>
<headline>Littlefield, Adams &amp; Co sees Q1 loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Littlefield, Adams &amp; Co said Monday it expects to post a loss in the first quarter of about $596,000, or $0.21 a share.</p>
<p>In the prior year's first quarter, the company reported a profit of $0.08 per share.</p>
<p>The company said it would not release details as to why it expected to post a loss.  A spokesman said that information would be disclosed when it released its first quarter results around May 15.</p>
